# Global Environment
- Runtime: Linux (WSL2 environment).
- Startup Check: If a project root has no local AGENTS.md, briefly inspect its manifest (`package.json`, `pyproject.toml`, `Cargo.toml`, etc.) before running build or test commands.
--- end AGENTS.md ---
